        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A viral infectious disease that results_in infection, has_material_basis_in Lujo virus (Mammarenavirus lujoense), which has_symptom fever, has_symptom headache, has_symptom myalgia, has_symptom thrombocytopenia, and has_symptom bleeding. Bleeding is minor and not a prominent symptom.</obo:IAO_0000115>
