    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0051067">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A progeroid syndrome that is characterized by poor growth, abnormal skeletal features, and distinctive craniofacial features with sagging, thin skin, and decreased subcutaneous fat suggesting an aged appearance that is most pronounced in infancy and improves with time and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the SLC25A24 gene on chromosome 1p36.</obo:IAO_0000115>
