        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A syndrome that is characterized by early-onset obesity due to severe hyperphagia, pigmentary abnormalities, mainly pale skin and red hair, and secondary hypocortisolism and that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the POMC gene on chromosome 2p23.</obo:IAO_0000115>
