        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An amino acid metabolic disorder characterized by the body&apos;s inability to effectively break down lysine, arginine and ornithine and by renal hyperdiaminoaciduria, especially lysinuria, and by impaired formation of urea with hyperammonemia after protein ingestion. It has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the amino acid transporter gene SLC7A7 on chromosome 14q11.</obo:IAO_0000115>
