        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An epidermolysis bullosa simplex characterized by skin blisters originating in the deepest areas of the basal cell cytoplasm just above the hemidesmosomes, skin bruising and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the PLEC1 gene on chromosome 8q24.</obo:IAO_0000115>
