        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A syndrome characterized by degenerative and proliferative changes of the neuroretina resulting in congenital blindness along with progressive mental disorders in about 50% of patients and sensorineural deafness in about 33% of patients, and that has_material_basis_in mutation in the NDP gene on chromosome Xp11.</obo:IAO_0000115>
