        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A pseudohypoaldosteronism characterized by enal salt wasting and high concentrations of sodium in sweat, stool, and saliva that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in any one of 3 genes encoding subunits of the epithelial sodium channel (ENaC): SCNN1A, SCNN1B, or SCNN1G.</owl:annotatedTarget>
