        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A citrullinemia characterized by the sudden onset of various neuropsychologic symptoms such as disorientation, abnormal behavior, convulsions, and coma due to hyperammonemia that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the SLC25A13 gene on chromosome 7q21.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MIM:603471</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
