        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0060308"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An autosomal recessive intellectual developmental disorder characterized by congenital anomalies that mainly affect the cardiac and/or renal systems, dysmorphic craniofacial features apparent from birth, and mild to moderate neurodevelopmental delay, usually with hypotonia, delayed walking, impaired intellectual development, and poor speech acquisition, that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the PAN2 gene on chromosome 12q13.</obo:IAO_0000115>
