        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A congenital disorder of glycosylation I that is characterized by facial dysmorphism (microcephaly, high forehead, low posterior hairline, strabismus), hypotonia, failure to thrive, intractable seizures, developmental delay, persistent vomiting and gastric bleeding and has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the ALG11 gene on chromosome 13q14.</owl:annotatedTarget>
