        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A congenital disorder of glycosylation I that is characterized by intrauterine growth retardation, microcephaly, failure to thrive, developmental delay, intellectual disability, hypotonia, seizures, optic nerve atrophy and respiratory difficulties and has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the STT3B gene on chromosome 3p23.</owl:annotatedTarget>
