        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/doid#NCIthesaurus"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Distal myopathy with rimmed vacuoles is a valid exact synonym (GNE gene), this name has been reused by OMIM for another disease, MIM:617158 (SQSTM1 gene) [LS].</rdfs:comment>
