        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An amino acid metabolic disorder that are characterized phenotypically by hyperphenylalaninemia, depletion of the neurotransmitters dopamine and serotonin, and progressive cognitive and motor deficits and that has_material_basis_in autosomal recessive mutations in the genes encoding enzymes involved in the synthesis or regeneration of BH4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
