        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A rhizomelic chondrodysplasia punctate that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the FAR1 gene on chromosome 11p15, which is required for the conversion of fatty acyl-CoAs to fatty alcohols, causing reduction or complete loss of FAR1 activity result in peroxisomal FAR1 deficiency.</obo:IAO_0000115>
