        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0080110"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A contractures, pterygia, and spondylocarpotarsal fusion syndrome that is characterized by contractures of proximal and distal joints, pterygia involving the neck, axillae, elbows, and/or knees, as well as variable vertebral, carpal, and tarsal fusions and short stature and that has material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the MYH3 gene on chromosome 17p13.</obo:IAO_0000115>
