        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A congenital myopathy that is characterized by the onset of muscle weakness in infancy manifest as neonatal hypotonia, delayed motor development, and often distal contractures and that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the gene encoding titin (TTN) on chromosome 2q31.</obo:IAO_0000115>
