        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A bone development disease that is characterized by bowing of the femora, aplasia or hypoplasia of the fibulae and poly-, oligo-, and syndactyly that has_material_basis_in autosomal recessive inheritance of homozygous mutation in the Wnt family member 7A (WNT7A) gene on chromosome 3p25.</obo:IAO_0000115>
