        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A brachydactyly characterized by autosomal dominant inheritance of hypoplasia of the distal phalanges of the ulnar side of the hand and shortening of one or more metacarpals but normal stature.</owl:annotatedTarget>
