        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A childhood spinal muscular atrophy that is a severe form and is characterized by muscle weakness onset from birth to six months of age, the inability to sit unassisted and that has_material_basis_in a mutation or deletion in the telomeric copy of the SMN gene, known as SMN1, on chromosome 5q13.</obo:IAO_0000115>
