        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An opportunistic bacterial infectious disease that results_in disseminated infection in immunocompromised hosts, has_material_basis_in Nocardia asteroides. The infection has_symptom pneumonia, has_symptom cellulitis, has_symptom lesions in the brain or meninges, and has_symptom ascending regional lymphadenopathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
